    description: Some("A two-player game of gridiron — orange team versus white — where each side programs one of five offensive or defensive formations before every snap. The offense has four downs to move the ball past the first-down marker by running, passing or punting, while the defense hunts down the ball carrier to end the drive, all racing a five-minute clock that ticks only during live play."),
